      "reasons": [
        "The packet discusses LD identification processes and diagnostic procedures historically (1960–2000), but it does not explicitly define “identification” as “the process of deciding whether a learning disability is present by applying definitions, criteria, and diagnostic procedures.”",
        "The definition’s phrasing about “deciding whether…is present” and the specific mechanism (“applying definitions, criteria, and diagnostic procedures”) is not stated in the packet and appears to be an inference rather than direct support.",
